===Conjunction===
{{head|ru|conjunction}} {{lb|ru|invariable}}

# [[that]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[думать|ду́маю]], '''что''' [[он]] [[до́ма]].|I think '''that''' he's home.}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1973|author=w:ru:Михаил Булгаков|title=w:ru:Мастер и Маргарита|chapter=Глава II. Понтий Пилат|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:Richard Pevear and Larissa Volokhonsky|title2=Master and Margarita|location2=London|publisher2=Penguin Books|year2=1997|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=Прокуратор понял, '''что''' там на площади уже собралась несметная толпа взволнованных последними беспорядками жителей Ершалаима, '''что''' эта толпа в нетерпении ожидает вынесения приговора и '''что''' в ней кричат беспокойные продавцы воды.|t=The procurator understood '''that''' there, on the square, a numberless crowd of Yershalaim citizens, agitated by the recent disorders, had already gathered, '''that''' this crowd was waiting impatiently for the announcement of the sentences, and '''that''' restless water sellers were crying in its midst.}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|ru|pronoun|g=n}}

# {{lb|ru|interrogative}} [[what]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Что''' [[э́то]]?|'''What''' is this?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[не]] [[знать|зна́ет]], '''что''' [[э́то]] [[значить|зна́чит]].|He doesn’t know '''what''' this means.}}
# {{lb|ru|literary|relative}} [[that]], [[which]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[кни́га]], '''что''' [[на]] [[стол|столе́]]|the book '''that''' is on the table}}

====Usage notes====
* In informal speech, the genitive form {{m|ru|чего́}} often replaces the accusative and sometimes the nominative.

